{{Term/Store|Zapshroom|Zapshrooms|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Zapshroom}}
Zapshrooms can be found below [[Tree]]s in the [[Gerudo Highlands]] and in forests in [[Deep Akkala]]. They are also sold in [[Gerudo Town]] at [[Ardin]]'s [[Stal]]. When eaten raw, Zapshrooms can restore half of a [[Heart]]. Zapshrooms can also be cooked into [[Meal]]s using a [[Cooking Pot]] to grant [[Link]] [[Shock Resistance]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> Burning a Zapshroom with [[Fire]] will turn it into a [[Toasty Zapshroom]]. They can also be used at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] in [[Hateno Village]] to make Yellow [[Dye]].

